# Landing-page sample diet PDF

**Visual style:** all pages use the modern B&B report look (Food Plan page is the reference). See `.cursor/rules/modern-pdf-style.mdc`.

**Deliverable filename:** `docs/samples/b&bsamplediet.pdf` — overwrite in place when the user supplies a new sample.

**Download URL (unchanged for users):**

```
https://program-creator-3tzd.onrender.com/api/samples/sample-diet
```

**Inline preview (landing embed):** same URL with `?inline=1`

## Update the landing preview

1. Replace `docs/samples/b&bsamplediet.pdf` with the approved sample file.
2. **Commit** the PDF.
3. **`git push origin main`** (Render redeploys).
4. **Then** give the download link.

## Code paths

| Piece | Path |
|-------|------|
| Static file | `docs/samples/b&bsamplediet.pdf` |
| API route | `GET /api/samples/sample-diet` (`server/samplePdfDownloads.js`) |
| Live fallback (no static file) | `server/publicSampleDiet.js` |
| Landing embed | `index.html` → API URLs |
| Purchased PDF | `GET /api/programs/diet-pdf` (always live-rendered) |

## Do not

- Link before push — Render serves the previous file until deploy completes.
- Confuse the landing sample with `buildSampleDietPreviewPayload()` — local verify only.

## Verify locally

```
npm run verify:printout-calcs
npm run verify:pdf
```
